        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...As sharp as before.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...As sharp as before."
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Doctor's decisionmaking is still absolutely reliable. I can promise you this.",
