    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]   When communications are jammed, our teams should operate near the rendezvous point. That way, even if something happens to me or the scout...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "When communications are jammed, our teams should operate near the rendezvous point. That way, even if something happens to me or the scout..."
